{"displayStem":"복제분기점이 오른쪽으로 이동하는 모형이다. 검은 실선은 주형, 짧은 가로선은 새 가닥이며 그림의 3′ 표지는 새 가닥의 자유 말단이다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"직접 설계한 교육용 모식도·합성 자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C06 c06-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"교육용 자료 모식도\"><defs><marker id=\"c06arr\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L8 3.5L0 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"></path></marker><pattern id=\"c06hatch\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M0 8L8 0\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path></pattern></defs><g font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"><text x=\"250\" y=\"25\" text-anchor=\"middle\">분기점 이동 →</text><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"22\" y=\"87\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3′</text><text x=\"460\" y=\"87\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5′</text><text x=\"22\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5′</text><text x=\"460\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3′</text><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"black\" marker-end=\"url(#c06arr)\"></line><text x=\"75\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"middle\">가 5′</text><text x=\"370\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3′</text><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"black\" marker-end=\"url(#c06arr)\"></line><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"black\" marker-end=\"url(#c06arr)\"></line><text x=\"100\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3′</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5′</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3′</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5′</text><text x=\"405\" y=\"193\" text-anchor=\"middle\">나</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\">검은 긴 선: 주형 / 짧은 선: 새 가닥</text></g></svg></div></div>"]}